OL,3,AEmotions run high at the round table as
OL,4,ACelebrity Traitors banish two players
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from the third episode of The
OL,8,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,10,FWe normally expect raised voices,
OL,11,Fconflicting theories and dramatic
OL,12,Fshowdowns from the Celebrity Traitors.
OL,13,FBut as this year's first round table
OL,14,Fgot under way, the writing was on the
OL,15,Fcastle wall.
OL,17,FViewers who often get frustrated with
OL,18,Fthe faithful and root for them to
OL,19,Funcover a traitor had their wish firmly
OL,20,FRichard E Grant-ed on Thursday, as the
OL,21,Factor was banished in a landslide vote.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
