OL,3,AEmotions run high at the round table as
OL,4,ACelebrity Traitors banish two players
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis unusual strategy of revealing he
OL,7,Fwas a traitor to the other celebrities
OL,8,Fin the bar led to the first time in the
OL,9,FUK version of the show that a traitor
OL,10,Fhas been identified at the opening
OL,11,Fround table.
